       IDENTIFICATION DIVISION.
       PROGRAM-ID.    SWI60306.
      ******************************************************************
      *     PROGRAMA SWI60306.                                         *
      *                                                                *
      *     Associar movimentos
      ******************************************************************
      *     LOG ALTERACOES:                                            *
      *   USER     / DATA     /   REFERENCIA / OBSERVACOES             *
      *                                                                *
      ******************************************************************
       ENVIRONMENT DIVISION.
       CONFIGURATION SECTION.
       SPECIAL-NAMES.
           DECIMAL-POINT IS COMMA.

       DATA DIVISION.

      *-----------------------------------------------------------------
       WORKING-STORAGE SECTION.
      *-----------------------------------------------------------------
       01  FILLER                          PIC X(40) VALUE
           'INICIO WORKING-STORAGE SWI60306         '.

      *-----------------------------------------------------------------
      *            DECLARACOES DE DB2
      *-----------------------------------------------------------------
           EXEC SQL INCLUDE SWCD5808 END-EXEC.
           EXEC SQL INCLUDE SWCD5606 END-EXEC.
           EXEC SQL INCLUDE SWCD7204 END-EXEC.
           EXEC SQL INCLUDE SWCD8201 END-EXEC.
           EXEC SQL INCLUDE SQLCA    END-EXEC.

      *-----------------------------------------------------------------
      *            MENSAGEM DE INPUT E  OUTPUT
      *-----------------------------------------------------------------
       COPY SWCV6030.
       COPY SWCV6031.

      *-----------------------------------------------------------------
      *            AREAS DE TRABALHO
      *-----------------------------------------------------------------
       COPY VIAL0015.
       COPY VIAW0005.
       COPY VIAK0001.
       COPY VIAK0002.
       COPY SWCK0001.
       COPY SWCK0002.

       COPY ARCL0039.
       COPY ETCL0002.
       COPY AQCW0005.

      *-----------------------------------------------------------------
      *            AREAS DE TRABALHO
      *-----------------------------------------------------------------

      *-----------------------------------------------------------------
      *            SWITCH
      *-----------------------------------------------------------------
      *01  SW-SWITCH.

      *-----------------------------------------------------------------
      *            CONSTANTES
      *-----------------------------------------------------------------
       01  WS-CONSTANTES.
           05 CON-SWVT8201                 PIC  X(08) VALUE 'SWVT8201'.
           05 CON-SWVT7204                 PIC  X(08) VALUE 'SWVT7204'.
           05 CON-SWVT5808                 PIC  X(08) VALUE 'SWVT5808'.
           05 CON-SWVT5606                 PIC  X(08) VALUE 'SWVT5606'.
           05 CON-RC                       PIC  X(02) VALUE 'RC'.
           05 CON-M                        PIC  X(01) VALUE 'M'.
      *    05 CON-SIM                      PIC  X(01) VALUE 'S'.
           05 CON-DOIS-PONTOS              PIC  X(01) VALUE ':'.

      *-----------------------------------------------------------------
      *            VARIAVEIS
      *-----------------------------------------------------------------
       01  WS-VARIAVEIS.
           05 WS-MONTANTE                  PIC  ZZZZZZZZZZZZZZ9,99.
           05 WS-IDRECONC                  PIC  S9(13) COMP-3.

           05 WS-JOBID                     PIC  X(28).
           05 FILLER REDEFINES WS-JOBID.
              10 WS-JOBNBR                 PIC  X(06).
              10 FILLER                    PIC  X(01).
              10 WS-JOBUSR                 PIC  X(10).
              10 FILLER                    PIC  X(01).
              10 WS-JOBNME                 PIC  X(10).

           05 WS-HEX-OF                    PIC  X(32).

      * Cardinalidade p:q
           05 WS-COUNT-SWT58               PIC S9(09) COMP.
           05 WS-COUNT-SWT72               PIC S9(09) COMP.
           05 WS-P                         PIC  X(01).
           05 WS-Q                         PIC  X(01).
           05 WS-CNATREC-SWT58             PIC  X(03).
           05 WS-CNATREC-SWT72             PIC  X(03).

      *-----------------------------------------------------------------
      *            PROGRAM CONTROL
      *-----------------------------------------------------------------
       01  WS-PROGRAM-CONTROL.
           05 WS-PROGNAME                  PIC  X(08) VALUE 'SWI60306'.

      *-----------------------------------------------------------------
      *              DECLARACOES DE CURSORES DB2
      *-----------------------------------------------------------------
      *
      *-----------------------------------------------------------------
       01  FILLER                          PIC X(40) VALUE
           'FIM DA WORKING-STORAGE SWI60306         '.

      *-----------------------------------------------------------------
       LINKAGE SECTION.

      *-----------------------------------------------------------------
      *
       COPY VIAL0004.

            EXEC SQL INCLUDE VIAP0009 END-EXEC.

      *-----------------------------------------------------------------
      *            0000-MAINLINE
      *-----------------------------------------------------------------
       0000-MAINLINE.
           PERFORM 1000-INICIO-PROGRAMA
              THRU 1099-INICIO-PROGRAMA-EXIT.

           PERFORM 2000-PROC-PROGRAMA
              THRU 2099-PROC-PROGRAMA-EXIT.

           PERFORM 3000-FINAL-PROGRAMA
              THRU 3099-FINAL-PROGRAMA-EXIT.

       0099-MAINLINE-EXIT.
           COPY VIAP0004.

      *-----------------------------------------------------------------
      *            1000-INICIO-PROGRAMA
      *-----------------------------------------------------------------
       1000-INICIO-PROGRAMA.
           IF VIAL0001-DEBUG-SIM
              MOVE '1000-INICIO-PROGRAMA' TO VIAL0015-CALLER-ID
              PERFORM VIAP0015-TRATA-DEBUG
                 THRU VIAP0015-TRATA-DEBUG-EXIT
           END-IF.

           MOVE VIAL0001-MENSAGEM-INPUT    TO SWCV6030-MSG
                                              SWCV6031-MSG.
           MOVE SWCV6030-ASE               TO SWCV6031-ASE.
           MOVE SWCV6030-ADE               TO SWCV6031-ADE.

           INITIALIZE WS-VARIAVEIS.

           MOVE ALL '/'                    TO WS-JOBID.
           CALL 'ARM70300'
              USING WS-JOBNBR WS-JOBUSR WS-JOBNME
           END-CALL.

           IF VIAL0001-DEBUG-SIM
              MOVE '1000-INICIO-PROGRAMA'  TO VIAL0015-CALLER-ID
              MOVE 'WS-JOBID            '  TO VIAL0015-CAMPO-NM(1)
              MOVE  WS-JOBID               TO VIAL0015-CAMPO-VLR(1)
              PERFORM VIAP0015-TRATA-DEBUG
                 THRU VIAP0015-TRATA-DEBUG-EXIT
           END-IF.

       1099-INICIO-PROGRAMA-EXIT.
           EXIT.

      *-----------------------------------------------------------------
      *            2000-PROC-PROGRAMA
      *-----------------------------------------------------------------
       2000-PROC-PROGRAMA.
           IF VIAL0001-DEBUG-SIM
              MOVE '2000-PROC-PROGRAMA' TO VIAL0015-CALLER-ID
              PERFORM VIAP0015-TRATA-DEBUG
                 THRU VIAP0015-TRATA-DEBUG-EXIT
           END-IF.

           MOVE SWCV6030-IDRECON           TO SWCV6031-IDRECON.
           MOVE SWCV6030-MRNOPR            TO SWCV6031-MRNOPR.
           MOVE SWCV6030-MRNORD            TO SWCV6031-MRNORD.
           MOVE SWCV6030-COSN              TO SWCV6031-COSN.
           MOVE SWCV6030-COSNC             TO SWCV6031-COSNC.

           PERFORM 2100-VALIDACOES
              THRU 2100-VALIDACOES-EXIT.

      * Inserir movimento na reconciliacao
           IF VIAL0002-SEM-ERROS
              PERFORM 2200-INSERE-MOVIM
                 THRU 2200-INSERE-MOVIM-EXIT
           END-IF.

      * Calcular cardinalidade
           IF VIAL0002-SEM-ERROS
              PERFORM 2300-CALCULA-CNATREC
                 THRU 2300-CALCULA-CNATREC-EXIT
           END-IF.

      * Actualizar cardinalidade dos mov externos
           IF VIAL0002-SEM-ERROS
              PERFORM 2400-ACTUALIZA-SWT58
                 THRU 2400-ACTUALIZA-SWT58-EXIT
           END-IF.

      * Actualizar cardinalidade dos mov internos
           IF VIAL0002-SEM-ERROS
              PERFORM 2500-ACTUALIZA-SWT72
                 THRU 2500-ACTUALIZA-SWT72-EXIT
           END-IF.

       2099-PROC-PROGRAMA-EXIT.
           EXIT.

      *-----------------------------------------------------------------
      *                   2100-VALIDACOES
      *-----------------------------------------------------------------
       2100-VALIDACOES.
           IF VIAL0001-DEBUG-SIM
              MOVE '2100-VALIDACOES' TO VIAL0015-CALLER-ID
              PERFORM VIAP0015-TRATA-DEBUG
                 THRU VIAP0015-TRATA-DEBUG-EXIT
           END-IF.

       2100-VALIDACOES-EXIT.
           EXIT.

      *-----------------------------------------------------------------
      *                     2200-INSERE-MOVIM
      *-----------------------------------------------------------------
       2200-INSERE-MOVIM.
           IF VIAL0001-DEBUG-SIM
              MOVE '2200-INSERE-MOVIM'     TO VIAL0015-CALLER-ID
              PERFORM VIAP0015-TRATA-DEBUG
                 THRU VIAP0015-TRATA-DEBUG-EXIT
           END-IF.

      * Inicializacoes
           INITIALIZE DCLSWCD8201     REPLACING NUMERIC BY ZEROES
                                           ALPHANUMERIC BY SPACES.
           MOVE SWCV6030-IDRECON           TO SWCD8201-IDRECONC.
           MOVE SWCV6030-MRNOPR            TO SWCD8201-MRNOPR.
           MOVE SWCV6030-MRNORD            TO SWCD8201-MRNORD.
           MOVE SWCV6030-COSN              TO SWCD8201-COSN.
           MOVE SWCV6030-COSNC             TO SWCD8201-COSNC.
           MOVE VIAL0001-DATA-PROCESSO-I   TO SWCD8201-DATREC.
           MOVE VIAL0001-CUTILIZA-I        TO SWCD7204-CUSERID.

           MOVE VIAL0001-DATA-PROCESSO-I   TO SWCV6031-DATAOPE.

      * Determinar SWCD8201-NSEQ
           IF VIAL0002-SEM-ERROS
              PERFORM 2210-OBTEM-NSEQ
                 THRU 2210-OBTEM-NSEQ-EXIT
           END-IF.

      * Inserir movimento nas reconciliacoes
           IF VIAL0002-SEM-ERROS
              PERFORM 2220-INSERE-SWT82
                 THRU 2220-INSERE-SWT82-EXIT
           END-IF.

      * Actualiza reconciliacao no movimento
           IF VIAL0002-SEM-ERROS
              PERFORM 2230-ACTUALIZA-MOVIM
                 THRU 2230-ACTUALIZA-MOVIM-EXIT
           END-IF.

       2200-INSERE-MOVIM-EXIT.
           EXIT.

      *-----------------------------------------------------------------
      *                     2210-OBTEM-NSEQ
      *-----------------------------------------------------------------
       2210-OBTEM-NSEQ.
           IF VIAL0001-DEBUG-SIM
              MOVE '2210-OBTEM-NSEQ'       TO VIAL0015-CALLER-ID
              MOVE 'SWCD8201-IDRECONC'     TO VIAL0015-CAMPO-NM(1)
              MOVE  SWCD8201-IDRECONC      TO VIAL0015-CAMPO-VLR(1)
              PERFORM VIAP0015-TRATA-DEBUG
                 THRU VIAP0015-TRATA-DEBUG-EXIT
           END-IF.

           EXEC SQL
              SELECT IFNULL(MAX(NSEQ), 0) + 1
                INTO :SWCD8201-NSEQ
                FROM SWVT8201
               WHERE IDRECONC = :SWCD8201-IDRECONC
           END-EXEC.

           MOVE CON-SWVT8201               TO VIAL0002-TABLE-NAME.

           PERFORM 9020-DB2CHECK
              THRU 9029-DB2CHECK-EXIT.

           IF VIAL0001-DEBUG-SIM
              MOVE '2410-OBTEM-NSEQ'         TO VIAL0015-CALLER-ID
              MOVE 'SWCD8201-IDRECONC'       TO VIAL0015-CAMPO-NM(1)
              MOVE  SWCD8201-IDRECONC        TO VIAL0015-CAMPO-VLR(1)
              MOVE 'SWCD8201-NSEQ    '       TO VIAL0015-CAMPO-NM(2)
              MOVE  SWCD8201-NSEQ            TO VIAL0015-CAMPO-VLR(2)
              MOVE 'SQLCODE          '       TO VIAL0015-CAMPO-NM(3)
              MOVE  SQLCODE                  TO VIAL0015-CAMPO-VLR(3)
              MOVE 'VIAL0002-COD-ERRO-GRAVE' TO VIAL0015-CAMPO-NM(4)
              MOVE  VIAL0002-COD-ERRO-GRAVE  TO VIAL0015-CAMPO-VLR(4)
              MOVE 'VIAL0002-IND-ERROS'      TO VIAL0015-CAMPO-NM(5)
              MOVE  VIAL0002-IND-ERROS       TO VIAL0015-CAMPO-VLR(5)
              PERFORM VIAP0015-TRATA-DEBUG
                 THRU VIAP0015-TRATA-DEBUG-EXIT
           END-IF.

       2210-OBTEM-NSEQ-EXIT.
           EXIT.

      *-----------------------------------------------------------------
      *                     2220-INSERE-SWT82
      *-----------------------------------------------------------------
       2220-INSERE-SWT82.
           IF VIAL0001-DEBUG-SIM
              MOVE '2220-INSERE-SWT82'     TO VIAL0015-CALLER-ID
              PERFORM VIAP0015-TRATA-DEBUG
                 THRU VIAP0015-TRATA-DEBUG-EXIT
           END-IF.

           EXEC SQL
              INSERT INTO SWVT8201
                   ( IDRECONC
                   , NSEQ
                   , MRNOPR
                   , MRNORD
                   , COSN
                   , COSNC
                   , DATREC
                   , CUSERID
                   , HTIMEST
                   )
               VALUES (
                     :SWCD8201-IDRECONC
                   , :SWCD8201-NSEQ
                   , :SWCD8201-MRNOPR
                   , :SWCD8201-MRNORD
                   , :SWCD8201-COSN
                   , :SWCD8201-COSNC
                   , :SWCD8201-DATREC
                   , :SWCD8201-CUSERID
                   , CURRENT TIMESTAMP
                   )
           END-EXEC.

           MOVE CON-SWVT8201               TO VIAL0002-TABLE-NAME.

           PERFORM 9020-DB2CHECK
              THRU 9029-DB2CHECK-EXIT.

           IF NOT DB2-OK AND NOT DB2-NOTFND
              SET VIAL0002-ABEND-DB2       TO TRUE
              MOVE SWCK0002-STATUS-ACTIVO  TO SWCV6031-IDRECON-S
              MOVE SWCK0001-ERR-CRIACAO    TO SWCV6031-IDRECON-MSG
              MOVE SWCK0002-CAPLIC         TO SWCV6031-IDRECON-CAPLIC
           END-IF.

       2220-INSERE-SWT82-EXIT.
           EXIT.

      *-----------------------------------------------------------------
      *                     2230-ACTUALIZA-MOVIM
      *-----------------------------------------------------------------
       2230-ACTUALIZA-MOVIM.
           IF VIAL0001-DEBUG-SIM
              MOVE '2230-ACTUALIZA-MOVIM'  TO VIAL0015-CALLER-ID
              PERFORM VIAP0015-TRATA-DEBUG
                 THRU VIAP0015-TRATA-DEBUG-EXIT
           END-IF.

           EVALUATE TRUE
            WHEN SWCV6030-COSN  NOT EQUAL SPACES
            AND  SWCV6030-COSNC NOT EQUAL SPACES
              PERFORM 2231-ACTUALIZA-SWT58
                 THRU 2231-ACTUALIZA-SWT58-EXIT
              IF VIAL0002-SEM-ERROS
                 PERFORM 2232-ACTUALIZA-SWT56
                    THRU 2232-ACTUALIZA-SWT56-EXIT
              END-IF

            WHEN SWCV6030-MRNOPR NOT EQUAL ZEROES
            AND  SWCV6030-MRNORD NOT EQUAL ZEROES
              PERFORM 2233-ACTUALIZA-SWT72
                 THRU 2233-ACTUALIZA-SWT72-EXIT

           END-EVALUATE.

       2230-ACTUALIZA-MOVIM-EXIT.
           EXIT.

      *-----------------------------------------------------------------
      *                     2231-ACTUALIZA-SWT58
      *-----------------------------------------------------------------
       2231-ACTUALIZA-SWT58.
           IF VIAL0001-DEBUG-SIM
              MOVE '2231-ACTUALIZA-SWT58'  TO VIAL0015-CALLER-ID
              PERFORM VIAP0015-TRATA-DEBUG
                 THRU VIAP0015-TRATA-DEBUG-EXIT
           END-IF.

           MOVE SWCV6031-COSN              TO SWCD5808-COSN.
           MOVE SWCV6031-COSNC             TO SWCD5808-COSNC.

           MOVE SWCV6031-IDRECON           TO SWCD5808-IDRECONC.
           MOVE CON-RC                     TO SWCD5808-CCODEST.
           MOVE CON-M                      TO SWCD5808-CTIPREC.

           MOVE VIAL0001-DATA-PROCESSO-I   TO AQCW0005-DTX10.
           PERFORM AQCP0005-CONV-DT10INDT8
              THRU AQCP0005-CONV-DT10INDT8-EXIT.
           MOVE AQCW0005-DT98              TO SWCD5808-DATREC.

           MOVE VIAL0001-CUTILIZA-I        TO SWCD5808-CUSERID.

           EXEC SQL
              UPDATE SWVT5808
                 SET IDRECONC = :SWCD5808-IDRECONC
                   , CCODEST  = :SWCD5808-CCODEST
                   , CTIPREC  = :SWCD5808-CTIPREC
                   , DATREC   = :SWCD5808-DATREC
                   , CUSERID  = :SWCD5808-CUSERID
                   , HTIMEST  = CURRENT TIMESTAMP
               WHERE COSN     = :SWCD5808-COSN
                 AND COSNC    = :SWCD5808-COSNC
           END-EXEC.

           MOVE CON-SWVT5808               TO VIAL0002-TABLE-NAME.

           PERFORM 9020-DB2CHECK
              THRU 9029-DB2CHECK-EXIT.

           IF NOT DB2-OK AND NOT DB2-NOTFND
              SET VIAL0002-ABEND-DB2       TO TRUE
              MOVE SWCK0002-STATUS-ACTIVO  TO SWCV6031-IDRECON-S
              MOVE SWCK0001-ERR-CRIACAO    TO SWCV6031-IDRECON-MSG
              MOVE SWCK0002-CAPLIC         TO SWCV6031-IDRECON-CAPLIC
           END-IF.

       2231-ACTUALIZA-SWT58-EXIT.
           EXIT.

      *-----------------------------------------------------------------
      *                     2232-ACTUALIZA-SWT56
      *-----------------------------------------------------------------
       2232-ACTUALIZA-SWT56.
           IF VIAL0001-DEBUG-SIM
              MOVE '2232-ACTUALIZA-SWT56'  TO VIAL0015-CALLER-ID
              PERFORM VIAP0015-TRATA-DEBUG
                 THRU VIAP0015-TRATA-DEBUG-EXIT
           END-IF.

           MOVE SWCV6031-COSN              TO SWCD5808-COSN.
           MOVE SWCV6031-COSNC             TO SWCD5808-COSNC.

           EXEC SQL
              SELECT CREF
                   , CREFOPR
                   , CREFEXT
                INTO :SWCD5808-CREF
                   , :SWCD5808-CREFOPR
                   , :SWCD5808-CREFEXT
                FROM SWVT5808
               WHERE COSN     = :SWCD5808-COSN
                 AND COSNC    = :SWCD5808-COSNC
           END-EXEC.

           MOVE CON-SWVT5808               TO VIAL0002-TABLE-NAME.

           PERFORM 9020-DB2CHECK
              THRU 9029-DB2CHECK-EXIT.

           EVALUATE TRUE
            WHEN DB2-OK
              MOVE SWCV6031-IDRECON           TO SWCD5606-IDRECONC
              MOVE CON-RC                     TO SWCD5606-CCODEST
              MOVE CON-M                      TO SWCD5606-CTIPREC

              MOVE VIAL0001-DATA-PROCESSO-I   TO AQCW0005-DTX10
              PERFORM AQCP0005-CONV-DT10INDT8
                 THRU AQCP0005-CONV-DT10INDT8-EXIT
              MOVE AQCW0005-DT98              TO SWCD5606-DATREC

              MOVE VIAL0001-CUTILIZA-I        TO SWCD5606-CUSERID

              EXEC SQL
                 UPDATE SWVT5606
                    SET IDRECONC = :SWCD5606-IDRECONC
                      , CCODEST  = :SWCD5606-CCODEST
                      , CTIPREC  = :SWCD5606-CTIPREC
                      , DATREC   = :SWCD5606-DATREC
                      , CUSERID  = :SWCD5606-CUSERID
                      , HTIMEST  = CURRENT TIMESTAMP
                  WHERE CROPR IN ( :SWCD5808-CREF
                                 , :SWCD5808-CREFOPR
                                 , :SWCD5808-CREFEXT
                                 )
                     OR CRCLI IN ( :SWCD5808-CREF
                                 , :SWCD5808-CREFOPR
                                 , :SWCD5808-CREFEXT
                                 )
              END-EXEC

              MOVE CON-SWVT5606               TO VIAL0002-TABLE-NAME

              PERFORM 9020-DB2CHECK
                 THRU 9029-DB2CHECK-EXIT

              IF NOT DB2-OK AND NOT DB2-NOTFND
                 SET VIAL0002-ABEND-DB2       TO TRUE
                 MOVE SWCK0002-STATUS-ACTIVO  TO SWCV6031-IDRECON-S
                 MOVE SWCK0001-ERR-CRIACAO    TO SWCV6031-IDRECON-MSG
                 MOVE SWCK0002-CAPLIC         TO SWCV6031-IDRECON-CAPLIC
              END-IF

            WHEN DB2-NOTFND
              CONTINUE

            WHEN OTHER
              SET VIAL0002-ABEND-DB2       TO TRUE
              MOVE SWCK0002-STATUS-ACTIVO  TO SWCV6031-IDRECON-S
              MOVE SWCK0001-ERR-CRIACAO    TO SWCV6031-IDRECON-MSG
              MOVE SWCK0002-CAPLIC         TO SWCV6031-IDRECON-CAPLIC

           END-EVALUATE.

       2232-ACTUALIZA-SWT56-EXIT.
           EXIT.

      *-----------------------------------------------------------------
      *                     2233-ACTUALIZA-SWT72
      *-----------------------------------------------------------------
       2233-ACTUALIZA-SWT72.
           IF VIAL0001-DEBUG-SIM
              MOVE '2233-ACTUALIZA-SWT72 '  TO VIAL0015-CALLER-ID
              PERFORM VIAP0015-TRATA-DEBUG
                 THRU VIAP0015-TRATA-DEBUG-EXIT
           END-IF.

           MOVE SWCV6031-IDRECON           TO SWCD7204-IDRECONC.
           MOVE SWCV6031-MRNOPR            TO SWCD7204-MRNOPR.
           MOVE SWCV6031-MRNORD            TO SWCD7204-MRNORD.
           MOVE CON-RC                     TO SWCD7204-CCODEST.
           MOVE CON-M                      TO SWCD7204-CTIPREC.
           MOVE VIAL0001-CUTILIZA-I        TO SWCD7204-CUSERID.


           EXEC SQL
              UPDATE SWVT7204
                 SET IDRECONC = :SWCD7204-IDRECONC
                   , CTIPREC  = :SWCD7204-CTIPREC
                   , CCODEST  = :SWCD7204-CCODEST
                   , CUSERID  = :SWCD7204-CUSERID
                   , HTIMEST  = CURRENT TIMESTAMP
               WHERE MRNOPR   = :SWCD7204-MRNOPR
                 AND MRNORD   = :SWCD7204-MRNORD
           END-EXEC.

           MOVE CON-SWVT7204               TO VIAL0002-TABLE-NAME.

           PERFORM 9020-DB2CHECK
              THRU 9029-DB2CHECK-EXIT.

           IF NOT DB2-OK AND NOT DB2-NOTFND
              SET VIAL0002-ABEND-DB2       TO TRUE
              MOVE SWCK0002-STATUS-ACTIVO  TO SWCV6031-IDRECON-S
              MOVE SWCK0001-ERR-CRIACAO    TO SWCV6031-IDRECON-MSG
              MOVE SWCK0002-CAPLIC         TO SWCV6031-IDRECON-CAPLIC
           END-IF.

       2233-ACTUALIZA-SWT72-EXIT.
           EXIT.

      *-----------------------------------------------------------------
      *                     2300-CALCULA-CNATREC
      *-----------------------------------------------------------------
       2300-CALCULA-CNATREC.

           IF VIAL0001-DEBUG-SIM
              MOVE '2300-CALCULA-CNATREC'   TO VIAL0015-CALLER-ID
              PERFORM VIAP0015-TRATA-DEBUG
                 THRU VIAP0015-TRATA-DEBUG-EXIT
           END-IF.

      * Contar movs extracto na reconciliacao
           PERFORM 2310-CONTAR-EXT
              THRU 2310-CONTAR-EXT-EXIT.

      * Contar mov internos na reconciliacao
           IF VIAL0002-SEM-ERROS
              PERFORM 2320-CONTAR-INT
                 THRU 2320-CONTAR-INT-EXIT
           END-IF.

      * Determinar cardinalidade (CNATREC)
           IF VIAL0002-SEM-ERROS
              PERFORM 2330-CALC-CNATREC
                 THRU 2330-CALC-CNATREC-EXIT
           END-IF.

       2300-CALCULA-CNATREC-EXIT.
           EXIT.

      *-----------------------------------------------------------------
      *                     2310-CONTAR-EXT
      *-----------------------------------------------------------------
       2310-CONTAR-EXT.
           IF VIAL0001-DEBUG-SIM
              MOVE '2310-CONTAR-EXT'       TO VIAL0015-CALLER-ID
              PERFORM VIAP0015-TRATA-DEBUG
                 THRU VIAP0015-TRATA-DEBUG-EXIT
           END-IF.

           EXEC SQL
              SELECT COUNT(COSN)
                INTO :WS-COUNT-SWT58
                FROM SWVT8201
               WHERE IDRECONC = :SWCD8201-IDRECONC
                 AND COSN     <> " "
                 AND COSNC    <> " "
           END-EXEC.

           MOVE CON-SWVT8201               TO VIAL0002-TABLE-NAME.

           PERFORM 9020-DB2CHECK
              THRU 9029-DB2CHECK-EXIT.

           IF VIAL0002-SEM-ERROS
              IF NOT DB2-OK
                 MOVE VIAK0002-ABEND-DB2   TO VIAL0002-IND-ERROS
                 MOVE VIAK0001-ERRO-DB2    TO VIAL0002-COD-ERRO-GRAVE
              END-IF
           END-IF.

       2310-CONTAR-EXT-EXIT.
           EXIT.

      *-----------------------------------------------------------------
      *                     2320-CONTAR-INT
      *-----------------------------------------------------------------
       2320-CONTAR-INT.
           IF VIAL0001-DEBUG-SIM
              MOVE '2320-CONTAR-INT'       TO VIAL0015-CALLER-ID
              PERFORM VIAP0015-TRATA-DEBUG
                 THRU VIAP0015-TRATA-DEBUG-EXIT
           END-IF.

           EXEC SQL
              SELECT COUNT(MRNOPR)
                INTO :WS-COUNT-SWT72
                FROM SWVT8201
               WHERE IDRECONC = :SWCD8201-IDRECONC
                 AND MRNOPR   <> 0
                 AND MRNORD   <> 0
           END-EXEC.

           MOVE CON-SWVT8201               TO VIAL0002-TABLE-NAME.

           PERFORM 9020-DB2CHECK
              THRU 9029-DB2CHECK-EXIT.

           IF VIAL0002-SEM-ERROS
              IF NOT DB2-OK
                 MOVE VIAK0002-ABEND-DB2   TO VIAL0002-IND-ERROS
                 MOVE VIAK0001-ERRO-DB2    TO VIAL0002-COD-ERRO-GRAVE
              END-IF
           END-IF.

       2320-CONTAR-INT-EXIT.
           EXIT.

      *-----------------------------------------------------------------
      *                     2330-CALC-CNATREC
      *-----------------------------------------------------------------
       2330-CALC-CNATREC.
           IF VIAL0001-DEBUG-SIM
              MOVE '2330-CALC-CNATREC'     TO VIAL0015-CALLER-ID
              PERFORM VIAP0015-TRATA-DEBUG
                 THRU VIAP0015-TRATA-DEBUG-EXIT
           END-IF.

           EVALUATE WS-COUNT-SWT58
            WHEN 0
              MOVE '0'                     TO WS-P
            WHEN 1
              MOVE '1'                     TO WS-P
            WHEN OTHER
              MOVE 'n'                     TO WS-P
           END-EVALUATE.

           EVALUATE WS-COUNT-SWT72
            WHEN 0
              MOVE '0'                     TO WS-Q
            WHEN 1
              MOVE '1'                     TO WS-Q
            WHEN OTHER
              MOVE 'n'                     TO WS-Q
           END-EVALUATE.

           MOVE WS-P                       TO WS-CNATREC-SWT58(1:1).
           MOVE CON-DOIS-PONTOS            TO WS-CNATREC-SWT58(2:1).
           MOVE WS-Q                       TO WS-CNATREC-SWT58(3:1).

           MOVE WS-Q                       TO WS-CNATREC-SWT72(1:1).
           MOVE CON-DOIS-PONTOS            TO WS-CNATREC-SWT72(2:1).
           MOVE WS-P                       TO WS-CNATREC-SWT72(3:1).

       2330-CALC-CNATREC-EXIT.
           EXIT.

      *-----------------------------------------------------------------
      *                     2400-ACTUALIZA-SWT58
      *-----------------------------------------------------------------
       2400-ACTUALIZA-SWT58.
           IF VIAL0001-DEBUG-SIM
              MOVE '2400-ACTUALIZA-SWT58'  TO VIAL0015-CALLER-ID
              PERFORM VIAP0015-TRATA-DEBUG
                 THRU VIAP0015-TRATA-DEBUG-EXIT
           END-IF.

           MOVE SWCV6031-IDRECON           TO SWCD5808-IDRECONC.
           MOVE WS-CNATREC-SWT58           TO SWCD5808-CNATREC.

           EXEC SQL
              UPDATE SWVT5808
                 SET CNATREC  = :SWCD5808-CNATREC
               WHERE IDRECONC = :SWCD5808-IDRECONC
           END-EXEC.

           MOVE CON-SWVT5808               TO VIAL0002-TABLE-NAME.

           PERFORM 9020-DB2CHECK
              THRU 9029-DB2CHECK-EXIT.

           IF NOT DB2-OK AND NOT DB2-NOTFND
              SET VIAL0002-ABEND-DB2       TO TRUE
              MOVE SWCK0002-STATUS-ACTIVO  TO SWCV6031-IDRECON-S
              MOVE SWCK0001-ERR-CRIACAO    TO SWCV6031-IDRECON-MSG
              MOVE SWCK0002-CAPLIC         TO SWCV6031-IDRECON-CAPLIC
           END-IF.

       2400-ACTUALIZA-SWT58-EXIT.
           EXIT.

      *-----------------------------------------------------------------
      *                     2500-ACTUALIZA-SWT72
      *-----------------------------------------------------------------
       2500-ACTUALIZA-SWT72.
           IF VIAL0001-DEBUG-SIM
              MOVE '2500-ACTUALIZA-SWT72 ' TO VIAL0015-CALLER-ID
              PERFORM VIAP0015-TRATA-DEBUG
                 THRU VIAP0015-TRATA-DEBUG-EXIT
           END-IF.

           MOVE SWCV6031-IDRECON           TO SWCD7204-IDRECONC.
           MOVE WS-CNATREC-SWT72           TO SWCD7204-CNATREC.

           EXEC SQL
              UPDATE SWVT7204
                 SET CNATREC  = :SWCD7204-CNATREC
               WHERE IDRECONC = :SWCD7204-IDRECONC
           END-EXEC.

           MOVE CON-SWVT7204               TO VIAL0002-TABLE-NAME.

           PERFORM 9020-DB2CHECK
              THRU 9029-DB2CHECK-EXIT.

           IF NOT DB2-OK AND NOT DB2-NOTFND
              SET VIAL0002-ABEND-DB2       TO TRUE
              MOVE SWCK0002-STATUS-ACTIVO  TO SWCV6031-IDRECON-S
              MOVE SWCK0001-ERR-CRIACAO    TO SWCV6031-IDRECON-MSG
              MOVE SWCK0002-CAPLIC         TO SWCV6031-IDRECON-CAPLIC
           END-IF.

       2500-ACTUALIZA-SWT72-EXIT.
           EXIT.

      *-----------------------------------------------------------------
      *            3000-FINAL-PROGRAMA
      *-----------------------------------------------------------------
       3000-FINAL-PROGRAMA.
           IF VIAL0001-DEBUG-SIM
              MOVE '3000-FINAL-PROGRAMA' TO VIAL0015-CALLER-ID
              PERFORM VIAP0015-TRATA-DEBUG
                 THRU VIAP0015-TRATA-DEBUG-EXIT
           END-IF.

           MOVE SWCV6031-MSG               TO VIAL0001-MENSAGEM-OUTPUT.
           MOVE SWCV6031-LENGTH            TO VIAL0001-LENGTH-MSG.
           MOVE SWCV6031-NR-CAMPOS         TO VIAL0001-NR-CAMPOS.

       3099-FINAL-PROGRAMA-EXIT.
           EXIT.

      *-----------------------------------------------------------------
           EXEC SQL INCLUDE VIAP0003 END-EXEC.
      *==============================================================
           COPY VIAP0015.
           COPY ARCR0039.
           COPY AQCP0005.
